    <string name="calibration_section">Mount Calibration</string>
    <string name="calibration_intro">Mount calibration workflow: choose two-star or three-star calibration, then choose a target. After starting, each star follows: Set Target, manually center the mount, then Sync After Centering. The button returns to Set Target until the selected star count is complete. Saved models can be used for GOTO and tracking compensation. Refine PA requires a 3-star or larger equatorial model; alt-az mode does not need polar refinement.</string>
